    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.1.desc",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Peri sets the scene and asks your child what they notice. No right answer yet — just looking."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.1.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "페리가 장면을 설정하고 자신의 아이에게 눈여겨보는 것을 요청합니다. 아직 올바른 답변은 없습니다 — 단지 관찰하기만 한다.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.1.desc-2026-07-06T08:42:27.794955+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.1.desc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.2.desc-2026-07-06T08:42:27.794955+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-06T08:42:27.794955+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.2.desc",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Your child records what they see, hear, or measure. Peri prompts for specifics if the answer is vague."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.2.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "자신의 아이가 보고 들으며 측정할 수 있는 것을 녹음합니다. 불명확한 답변에 대해서는 페리가 자세히 질문합니다.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.2.desc-2026-07-06T08:42:27.794955+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.2.desc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.3.desc-2026-07-06T08:42:27.794955+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-06T08:42:27.794955+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.3.desc",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Peri asks comparison and classification questions. What\\'s similar? What\\'s different? What pattern do you see?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.3.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "페리가 비교와 분류 질문을 합니다. 같은 것은 무엇입니까? 다른 것은 무엇입니까? 볼 수 있는 패턴이 어떻게 보입니까?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.3.desc-2026-07-06T08:42:27.794955+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.3.desc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.4.desc-2026-07-06T08:42:32.751609+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-06T08:42:32.751609+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.4.desc",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Your child proposes a cause or mechanism. Peri tests it with evidence questions, not hints."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.4.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "어린 자식이 원인 또는 수단을 제시합니다. 피에리는 증거로 검증하기 위한 의문의 질문, 대신 힌트를 사용합니다.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.4.desc-2026-07-06T08:42:32.751609+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.4.desc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.5.desc-2026-07-06T08:42:32.751609+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-06T08:42:32.751609+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.5.desc",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Peri asks what this means for a new situation. Knowledge becomes portable."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.5.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "피에리가 새로운 상황에 대해 이것은 뜻하는 건지 물어봅니다. 지식이 포르테이블 됩니다.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.5.desc-2026-07-06T08:42:32.751609+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.5.desc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-2026-07-06T08:42:32.751609+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-06T08:42:32.751609+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.1.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "You\\'re at the creek bank. Before we measure anything — what\\'s the first thing you notice about the water right here versus ten feet upstream?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "여기서 덫 앞에 있습니다. 우리가 아무것도 측정하기 전에 — 여기서 물이 빠른 곳과 10 피트 위로 보이는 것을 처음에 어떤 것을 발견하나요?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-2026-07-06T08:42:32.751609+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.1.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-2026-07-06T08:42:32.751609+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-06T08:42:32.751609+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.2.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "It\\'s slower here and there\\'s more mud on the bottom."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "여기서는 더 느리고 바닷가 밑에 더 많은 먼지가 있습니다.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-2026-07-06T08:42:32.751609+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.2.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-2026-07-06T08:42:32.751609+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-06T08:42:32.751609+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.3.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Good observation. Why do you think the mud settled here and not upstream where the water is faster?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "좋은 관찰입니다. 이유로 여기에 먼지가 흩어진 것 같고 빠른 곳에서는 왜 그런 건가요?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-2026-07-06T08:42:32.751609+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.3.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-2026-07-06T08:42:38.098436+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-06T08:42:38.098436+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.4.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Maybe slower water can\\'t carry as much stuff?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": " slower water may not be able to carry as much things?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-2026-07-06T08:42:38.098436+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.4.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-2026-07-06T08:42:38.098436+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-06T08:42:38.098436+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.5.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "That\\'s the right direction. What could you measure or photograph here to support that idea?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": " That seems to be correct direction. What can you measure or photograph here to support that idea?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-2026-07-06T08:42:38.098436+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.5.text"
      }
    },
